ed to `nobinary` (default) or `binary` (not default) + `endofline` (default).\n- `fileencoding` switched to any value, but the one it was when last writing.\n- `fileformat` switched to any valu, but the one it was when last writing.\n- `binary` switched to `nobinary` with `fileformat` not equal to `unix`.\n\nIf this is one of the cases, then `modified` setting _must_ be set and I would say it is an error that `set all&` does not set this setting.\n\n// Though `modified` would actually be better be `v:modified` variable because buffer modification state is not a setting.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/128848577/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ZyX-I","id":322097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjA5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I","html_url":"https://github.com/ZyX-I","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":376791992,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDM3Njc5MTk5Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/376791992","actor":{"login":"ZyX-I","id":322097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjA5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://ava